{"name":"Stuffing","hex":"#bf9b84","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"stuffing","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of stuff"]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The matter used to stuff hollow objects such as pillows and saddles.","Any of many food items used to stuff another."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/stuffing"}],"entries":[{"title":"Stuffing","blocks":[{"text":"Stuffing, filling, or dressing is an edible mixture, often composed of herbs and a starch such as bread, used to fill a cavity in the preparation of another food item. Many foods may be stuffed, including poultry, seafood, and vegetables. As a cooking technique, stuffing helps retain moisture, while the mixture itself augments and absorbs flavors."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/Stuffing_a_turkey.jpg/330px-Stuffing_a_turkey.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stuffing","wikidata":"Q745361"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/Stuffed_turkey.jpg/500px-Stuffed_turkey.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/Stuffed_turkey.jpg/1280px-Stuffed_turkey.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/63/Stuffed_turkey.jpg/500px-Stuffed_turkey.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Stuffed turkey ","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AStuffed_turkey.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Empanadas_de_carne%2C_2006.jpg/500px-Empanadas_de_carne%2C_2006.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Empanadas_de_carne%2C_2006.